OL,3,GNEWSAAardman students told to stay
OL,4,A'wonky' in AI age
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an era when AI can create images and
OL,7,Fvideos in seconds, students at Bristol
OL,8,Fanimation giant Aardman are being
OL,9,Ftaught something machines struggle to
OL,10,Freplicate: embrace imperfection.
OL,12,FAt the studio behind Wallace and
OL,13,FGromit, Chicken Run and Shaun the
OL,14,FSheep, the next generation of animators
OL,15,Fare learning the painstaking art of
OL,16,Fstop-motion, where every blink, smile
OL,17,Fand tiny movement is created by hand.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34102
