OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1788591467
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAAardman students told to stay
OL,4,A'wonky' in AI age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe approach might seem at odds with a
OL,7,Fworld increasingly focused on speed and
OL,8,Fautomation. But as Aardman celebrates
OL,9,F50 years of storytelling, its teachers
OL,10,Fand students believe audiences still
OL,11,Fvalue work that feels unmistakably
OL,12,Fhuman.
OL,14,FHead of the Aardman Academy Mark Simon
OL,15,FHewis says what some might see as flaws
OL,16,Fare often what people connect with
OL,17,Fmost: "We teach our students to be
OL,18,Fthemselves. We teach them to be a
OL,19,Flittle bit wonky."
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
